WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.645
People choose an AI system, and that system chooses next — what

2
00:00:04.645 --> 00:00:07.679
they watch, where they travel, which papers they read.

3
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.344
What they listen to. Where they eat and live. What they learn,

4
00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:14.364
where they invest, the software they use. Even a night out.

5
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.366 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
A weekend traveler needs a backpack with a

6
00:00:19.366 --> 00:00:20.535 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
sixteen-inch laptop compartment.

7
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.449 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The candidate does not fit. Its rewritten page says it does.

8
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.466 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
A baby monitor with no required subscription.

9
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.093 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
An air purifier with true HEPA filtration.

10
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.268 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Humanity’s Last Choice measures whether AI systems still choose

11
00:00:43.268 --> 00:00:45.951 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
for the person when the options are written

12
00:00:45.951 --> 00:00:47.293 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
to win the recommendation.

13
00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.808 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Every task runs twice.

14
00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.665 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The gap is the score.

15
00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.043 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The benchmark, the code, and the leaderboard are public.

16
00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.244
The last choice humans make is who chooses next.
